{"id": "33863", "title": "吾爱晨欢", "author": "艾佟", "category": "文学名著", "count": 51, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/33/33863.htm", "intro": "为了帮老姊躲掉老爸安排的婚姻，她决定亲身下海去会会男主角。於是隐藏身分跑去应徵他公司的秘书。却在面试时，不识相的把他当鬼看。人家在她重病时，好心过来照顾。她却偷偷拍下他的裸照，好逼他退婚。但对於他的柔情关怀，她不自禁的恋上他。可是怎么告诉他，自己的真实身份及目的。谁知老爸突然叫她去相亲，相亲的对象居然是他。这下糟了，她只好往脸上画油漆，只希望他不要认出她来……", "base": "files/article/html/33/33863", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2153898.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2153899.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2153900.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2153901.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2153902.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2153903.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2153904.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2153905.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2153906.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2153907.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2153908.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2153909.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2153910.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2153911.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2153912.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2153913.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2153914.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2153915.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2153916.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2153917.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2153918.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2153919.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2153920.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2153921.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file": "2153922.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第26页